•	Group products according to sales characteristics.
•	Improve inventory replenishment planning.
•	Support evidence-based purchasing decisions.
An important limitation is that the Online Retail II dataset does not contain actual warehouse stock balances, supplier lead times, or stockout events.
These additional operational variables will be required before forecasting results can be converted into fully validated inventory replenishment recommendations.
